== Bootstrap process ==

Start with a freshly installed, minimal Debian 13 (Trixie):

  apt update
  apt upgrade
  apt dist-upgrade
  apt autoremove
  shutdown -r now

Then copy setup-environment.sh to the server and run it:
  chmod +x setup-environment.sh
  # For development
  ./setup-environment.sh dev.translatewiki.net
  # For production
  ./setup-environment.sh web3.translatewiki.net


== Manual configuration required for production ==
* Copy the hiera-eyaml keypair from the previous server:
  /root/secrets/puppet-hiera-eyaml/private_key.pkcs7.pem
  /root/secrets/puppet-hiera-eyaml/public_key.pkcs7.pem
* Copy/create the following files for keyholder:
  /root/keyholder/l10n-bot-2023
  /root/keyholder/l10n-bot-2023.pub
* Copy the SMTP relay credentials used by postfix:
  /root/postfix/sasl_passwd
* Copy the node eyaml file, which holds the stats.translatewiki.net basic auth
  accounts (secret_webauth) and the repong forge tokens (secret_forge_tokens)
* Put backup keys in /root/.ssh/
